  Security changes will cover three types: Password changed, Two-factor enabled and Email change requested.

  All three layouts cover failed sign-ins, security changes and picking one week. They differ in how many controls there
  are and in what someone can narrow to.

  - [1mA: two dropdowns, "Show" and "Week".[0m
